-> start

=== start ===
Welcome to Sovereign Chess.
Let's start with a small fight demo.
To use your powers, you first need to freeze time.
Tap the "Pause Grid" button.
-> wait_pause

=== wait_pause ===
Time is frozen!
Now, you can use Powers.
Tap "Assassinate" to select your deadly ability.
-> wait_assassinate

=== wait_assassinate ===
Good. Now, tap an enemy piece to assassinate it.
-> wait_target

=== wait_target ===
Oh no! Your plan failed!
The opponent used Protection!
We need a fallback strategy.
Use "Bribe" instead to bring them to our side.
-> wait_bribe

=== wait_bribe ===
Tap the same piece to bribe it to your side.
-> wait_bribe_target

=== wait_bribe_target ===
Great job! The piece is now yours.
That's the essence of Sovereign Chess. You're ready.
-> END
